cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "BEACON-ECG: Beyond-Echo Assessment of Cardiac structure and Outcome from a single 12-lead electrocardiogram"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-07-24
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21440882
abstract: >-
  Reproduction code for BEACON-ECG, a multitask deep-learning model that predicts
  echocardiographically-defined structural heart disease (HFrEF, severe aortic stenosis,
  left-ventricular hypertrophy, LVEF) and 1-year mortality from a single 12-lead ECG.
  Developed on MIMIC-IV / MIMIC-IV-ECG / MIMIC-IV-ECHO and externally validated without
  retraining on EchoNext (Columbia University Irving Medical Center). This repository
  contains code only; no patient data are redistributed.
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ArleneHarrison/beacon-ecg"
keywords:
  - electrocardiography
  - deep learning
  - structural heart disease
  - aortic stenosis
  - heart failure
  - external validation
  - MIMIC-IV

authors:
